Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}怎么会有人知道 你的信用卡号码{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How'd someone get your credit card number?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我也不知道 看看他们花了多少钱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I have no idea. Look how much they spent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}摩妮卡，冷静点，信用卡公司说 你只要付你有买东西的钱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Calm down. You only have to pay for the stuff you bought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但这真的是挥霍无度{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Still, it's just such reckless spending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想他们偷你的信用卡时…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}When somebody steals your credit card...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}早就将王法抛诸脑后了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...they've kind of already thrown caution to the wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哇，真是怪人 花了美金69点95元买神奇拖把{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wow, what a geek. They spent $69.95 on a Wonder Mop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是我买的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}噢，嗯心{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh! Oh, the yuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他又来了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}He's doing it again!{\r}
