Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不要这样 马塞尔，回来！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Stop humping! Now, Marcel, come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}过来这里，．马塞尔{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come here, Marcel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不要！别去我房间！ 我去抓他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, no, no! Not in my room! I'll get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}罗斯，你得想想办法{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You've got to do something about the humping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}干嘛？只是阶段性而已{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What? It's just a phase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们也是那样说乔伊的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, that's what we said about Joey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}放轻松点好吗  没什么大不了的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, would you all relax? It's not that big a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}马塞尔，给我停止！ 马塞尔！你这个坏猴子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}RACHEL: Marcel, stop it! Marcel! Bad monkey!{\r}
