Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}就说我的好奇娃娃 已经不再好奇了吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Let's just say my Curious George doll is no longer curious.{\r}
