Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}摩妮卡 你不会还在 看那个东西吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ugh, Monica, you are not still going over that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 这个女人过着我的生活 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- This woman's living my life. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她在过我的生活 而且过得比我好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She's living my life, and she's doing it better than me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你看看这个，看{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Look at this. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她买票去看我想看的戏{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She buys tickets to plays I want to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她买的衣服 是我早就想买的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She shops at stores that I'm intimidated by the salespeople.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（编剧：亚当·却斯  艾拉·安德里德）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她花三百美金在美术用品上{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She spent $300 on art supplies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你又不是艺术家{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're not an artist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}如果我有那些东西 或许就可以了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, well, I might be if I had the supplies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这些我都可以做啊 只是我都没做{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, I could do all this stuff. Only I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（导演：盖尔曼库索）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.05,0:02:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}摩妮卡，别这样 你也做很多很棒的事情啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, Monica, come on. You do cool things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是吗  来比较一下吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, really? Let's compare, shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}现在做比较 会不会太晚了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, it's so late for "shall we?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我会去公园骑马吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Do I go horseback riding in the park, hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我会在新学院大学上课吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Do I take classes at The New School?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 不会 - 不会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- No. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.15,0:02:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}太不公平了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This is so unfair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她有所有我要的东西 而且不用应付我妈{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She's got everything I want, and she doesn't have my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔伊·帕帕尼如何{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How about Joey Paponi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不行，太有种族意味了 我的经纪人觉得要取中立一点的名字{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, still too ethnic. My agent thinks I should have a name that's more neutral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔伊·瑞士{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Joey Switzerland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}而且我觉得叫乔就好  乔伊听起来好像我只有…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Plus I think it should be Joe. Joey makes me sound like I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这么大而已{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...this big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但我并不是{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Which I'm not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔、乔、乔… 史达林{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Joe, Joe, Joe... Stalin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}史达林{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Stalin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我听过那个名字吗  好耳熟{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Do I know that name? That sounds familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我没印象{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Well, it does not ring a bell with me. - Huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔·史达林{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Joe Stalin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还挺不错的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, that's pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还可以试试乔瑟夫{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You might want to try Joseph. - Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔瑟夫·史达林！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Joseph Stalin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 大家一定会记得！ - 当然啦！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- I think you'd remember that! - Oh, yes!{\r}
