Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（中央咖啡厅）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.67,0:08:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不敢相信，罗斯 这太扯了！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I can't believe it. This sucks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不懂，你才刚养他 怎么可能已经成年了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You just got him. How could he be an adult already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道  前一天 才小小只的…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know, I know. One day he's this little thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不知不觉中 就变成…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and before you know it, he's this little thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}紧抓我的腿不放的小东西{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...I can't get off my leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有办法能让你留下他吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Isn't there any way you can keep him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.98,0:09:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}兽医说除非有个地方…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The vet said that unless he's in a place where he has regular access...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}让他获得正常的猴爱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...to some monkey loving...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}否则他会愈来愈残暴{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...he's just gonna get vicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我得把他送到动物园{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I just gotta get him into a zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 要怎么把猴子送到动物园  - 我知道！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- How do you get a monkey into a zoo? - I know that one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不，那是教宗 进入福斯汽车{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, that's popes into a Volkswagen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们申请了很多动物园 首要选择当然是州立动物园{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We're applying to a lot of them. Our first choice would be a state zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}像是圣地牙哥{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, like, uh, San Diego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但那可能是遥不可及的梦想  因为他来自州外{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But that may just be a pipe dream because he's out-of-state.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的兽医在迈阿密有认识人 所以有可能去那里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}My vet knows someone at Miami, so that's a possibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但那里离海滩只有两条街  一定是轰趴动物园{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But that's two blocks from the beach. It's a total party zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Hey. CHANDLER: Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 嗨 - 我们找到那个女生了！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Hi. - We found the girl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 什么  - 有打电话给警察吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- What? - Did you call the cops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有，我们请她吃午餐{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Nope. We took her to lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们自己的私自执法方式{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ah. Your own brand of vigilante justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你疯了吗  这个女人偷了你的东西！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Are you insane? This woman stole from you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她偷东西，是小偷耶{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She stole! She's a stealer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}跟她相处十分钟之后 你就会忘掉这些了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}After you're with this woman for 10 minutes, you forget all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她真的是个奇女子…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, she's this astounding person...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}振奋人心！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...with this amazing spirit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是啊，可能是从啦啦队员 那里偷来的！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, which she probably stole from some cheerleader!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 把帽子脱掉 - 福斯车里的教宗！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Take off their hats. - Popes in a Volkswagen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗯哼{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Mm-hm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我超爱那个笑话{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I love that joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 不可能！你不可能这么做！ - 摩娜娜很勇敢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- No way! No way did you do this! - Monana was very brave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}超狂野的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It was so wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们跟他们说我们是 615号房的刚氏姐妹…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We told them we were the Gunnersons in room 615...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}才知道波士顿的《塞尔蒂克队》 包下整个六楼！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...only to find out the Boston Celtics had the entire sixth floor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}当他们发现 我们很矮而且有胸部后{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So when they caught on to the fact that we're short and have breasts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}就把我们轰出去 我被饭店赶出去，我耶！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They threw us out. I was thrown out of a hotel! Me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好样的，摩娜娜！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Go, Monana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不是只有你们活在梦想中{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, you ladies are not the only ones living the dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我得去为我不认识的人 倒咖啡了，不用等我了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I get to go pour coffee for people I don't know. Don't wait up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}噢，还有一件事…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, by the way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们明天要去参加 百老汇的试镜{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...tomorrow we're auditioning for a Broadway show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}《猫》剧有一个缺额{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}There's an open call for Cats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想说我们可以去 演唱《回忆》…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm thinking we go down there, sing "Memories"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.51,0:11:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}把自己当成傻子 你觉得如何？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and make complete fools of ourselves. What do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不、不、不{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}要记得我是什么样的人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Remember who you're dealing with here. Ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不像你，我连站在 踢踏舞教室前面都有困难{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm not like you. I can't even stand in front of a tap class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那大概是因为你有孟诺教派的背景{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's because of your Amish background.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 什么  - 你是宾州的荷兰人 对吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- What? - Well, you're Pennsylvania Dutch, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}直到我买了吹风机 就被逐出村里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Till I bought a blow dryer. Then I was shunned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我以前就跟你一样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I was just like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}然后有一天，我看了一部 改变我一生的电影{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And then one day, I saw a movie that changed my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你有看过《春风化雨》吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Did you ever see Dead Poets Society? - Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我觉得那部电影超级…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I thought that movie was so incredibly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}无聊的！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...boring!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}最后那个孩子自杀…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, that thing at the end where the kid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只因为不能参与话剧演出{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...kills himself because he can't be in the play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}搞什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}拜托，等个一年 离家参与社区话团演出不就行了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's like, "Kid, wait a year. Leave home, do some community theater!"{\r}
