Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.74,0:21:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好，麻烦把他带走 带他走吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, would you just take him away? Just take him.{\r}
